  "content": {
    "_uid": "b66ed6d7-d24a-949e-1de3-282de60be26d",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "0dacef0d-cbbd-e3b1-dc07-725c9ea49c2d",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "ELE_net offers two courses to help students achieve their IELTS goals, IELTS Preparation and Advanced. The Preparation course is a six-week introduction to all parts of the test. The Advanced course is ten weeks' long and focuses more on the speaking and writing parts of the test and developing higher-level language skills. Course participants on both courses complete interactive language activities, attend weekly webinars and receive individual feedback and estimated band scores on their test practice.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"It was a great opportunity, and this course has improved my knowledge and understanding of IELTS exam. Thank you for your support, guidance and knowledge that you provided us in this course.\" Adila Dilawar",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"I feel much more confident about taking IELTS now. Even though a lot of practice is still needed before attempting the exam, what I learnt from this course will stay with me. I especially enjoyed your live webinar sessions.\" Amjad Ali Shah",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Book now for the next IELTS Advanced course starting 15 July, or IELTS Preparation course starting 14 October.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Course details and online booking",
                  "type": "text",
